uli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le16ob09re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le16ob09re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le16ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le16ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Luther</span>: The food is heavenly. Vanessa is an exceptionally gifted cook.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I know. She always spoils us whenever we throw a party. Would you like more poutine?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Luther</span>: Don't mind if I do! I'm going to eat as much poutine as I can during my upcoming tour of Canada!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh! Where are you going to play?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Luther</span>: We'll be in Montreal, Toronto and Vancouver for two weeks. We're playing eight gigs in total. After that, we'll have a five-day break, followed by a series of shows in Europe."}, {"time": "27250", "image": "engenn6le16ob09re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That sounds exhausting! Do you sometimes get tired of being constantly on the road?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Luther</span>: I love this life! I'm naturally quite reserved, but when I get on stage, I become a totally different person.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: How so?"}, {"time": "39500", "image": "engenn6le16ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Luther</span>:  Playing gives me a chance to be more daring. I guess I'm more fearless behind my saxophone!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's like me and my articles! It allows me to be curious about everything. Actually, would you mind if I write a profile on you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Luther</span>: It would be a pleasure! My schedule is free tomorrow morning."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa and Sally Plan a Party"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Gift of the Gab"}, {"type": "position", "content": 9}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 16}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to describe people's behavior and personality."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Talking About Future Actions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "There are several ways in which we can talk about the future. Each of thsese tenses is associated to different situations."}, {"type": "text", "content": "We use the <span class=\"italic\">present simple</span> for something scheduled or arranged:<br><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">We have</span> a lesson next Monday.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "We can use the <span class=\"italic\">present continuous</span> for plans or arrangements:<br><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">I'm playing</span> footbal tomorrow.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "We use <span class=\"italic\">will</span> when we make predictions about the future:<br><span class=\"italic\">I think Italy <span class=\"strong\">will win</span> the World Cup.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "We also use <span class=\"italic\">will</span> to make offers or promises:<br><span class=\"italic\">Mary <span class=\"strong\">will help</span> you with your homework.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "We use <span class=\"italic\">(be) going to</span> to talk about plans and intentions:<br>I'<span class=\"strong\">m going to drive</span> to work today.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "We also use <span class=\"italic\">(be) going to</span> when we can see something is likely to happen:<br><span class=\"italic\">Be careful! <span class=\"strong\">You are going to fall</span>.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "To learn more, look at the chart below:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Going to</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Simple</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"decision made for the future\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"assumption with regard to the future\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"action already arranged for the near future\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"timetables\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"conclusion with regard to the future\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"assumption with regard to the future\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"fixed arangements in the near future\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"spontaneous decision\\\"}\",\"\",\"\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Respond Politely to Suggestions and Offers"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When someone offers suggestions, it is important to respond politely<br><br>Remember to use the modals <span class=\"italic\">could</span>, <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">might</span> to suggest something."}, {"type": "text", "content": " Here is a list of expressions you can use to give suggestions:<br>  <ul><li>You might want to \u2026</li> <li>Would you mind \u2026 ?</li> <li>You should \u2026</li> <li>You ought to \u2026 (strong request)</li></ul>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Responding to Offers and Suggestions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>I don't think I can \u2026</li> <li>I guess that could ...</li> <li>That would be \u2026</li> <li>I would \u2026</li> <li>Don't mind if I do!</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Would you like more poutine?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: Don't mind if I do! "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\"> Ann</span>: Would you mind if I do a profile on you? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: It would be a pleasure."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le16ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "heavenly"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "delicious (about food) "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The food is heavenly!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob09aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "gifted "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "extremely skilled"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Vanessa is an exceptionally gifted cook."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob09aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Don't mind if I do!"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " I would really like that! "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Ann: Would you like more poutine? Bob: Don't mind if I do!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob09aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "gig  "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "show, usually for music "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We're playing 8 gigs in total."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob09aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "exhausting "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "tiring "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Playing gigs all the time sounds exhausting!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob09aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "on the road "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "away from home; traveling "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I love life on the road!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob09aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "reserved "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "shy"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm naturally quite reserved."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob09aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "profile"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a long interview, usually about a famous person"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: Would you mind if I write a profile on you?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob09aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fearless "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "without fear, daring"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: I'm more fearless behind my saxophone."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob09aud09"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go online and find information about a few national dishes."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose 3 countries."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find out how much they cost and  where you can find them."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find out if they are made for a special occasion and if they are popular with the local people."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use the chart below to write down your information."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Talk about the dishes with your partner. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Country\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Name of the dish\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Cost\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Where do you find it?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Made for special occasion?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write about food."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about people's eating habits."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about actions in the future."}]}]}